sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant API
 participant Posting
 participant PostgreSQL
 User->>API: POST /api/transfers with Idempotency-Key
 API->>Posting: Actor and validated payload
 Posting->>PostgreSQL: Begin and lock actor/key
 alt Receipt exists
  PostgreSQL-->>Posting: Stored payload digest and outcome
  Posting-->>API: Replay or conflict
 else New request
  Posting->>PostgreSQL: Lock limits and accounts in UUID order
  Posting->>PostgreSQL: Read balance and UTC-day usage
  opt Accepted
   Posting->>PostgreSQL: Insert journal and two entries
  end
  Posting->>PostgreSQL: Persist outcome and audit then commit
  PostgreSQL-->>Posting: Commit or rollback
  Posting-->>API: Outcome
 end
 API-->>User: JSON and request ID
